@startuml
title EventBook — Detailed Customer Booking Sequence
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "Web client" as Client
participant "Booking API" as API
participant "Session / validation" as Validation
database "data.json repository" as Database

Customer -> Client : Browse/search events
Client -> API : GET /api/events?q=&sort=
API -> Database : Read event records
Database --> API : events and booked counts
API --> Client : Event list + remaining capacity

Customer -> Client : View details; choose ticket quantity
Client -> Client : Calculate visible total
Customer -> Client : Submit simulated payment
note right of Client
Card fields are validated in browser only.
Only eventId and quantity are sent to API.
end note
Client -> API : POST /api/bookings(eventId, quantity)
API -> Validation : Get customer session and require customer role

alt no valid customer session
  Validation --> API : unauthorised
  API --> Client : 401 error
  Client --> Customer : Ask user to log in
else authorised customer
  API -> Validation : Check positive whole quantity
  alt invalid quantity
    Validation --> API : invalid
    API --> Client : 400 quantity error
    Client --> Customer : Explain validation error
  else valid quantity
    API -> Database : Read target event
    Database --> API : capacity, booked and price
    API -> Validation : Check booked + quantity <= capacity
    alt insufficient capacity
      Validation --> API : rejected
      API --> Client : 400 remaining-ticket error
      Client --> Customer : Show availability error
    else capacity available
      Validation --> API : accepted
      API -> Database : Increment booked; append Confirmed booking
      Database --> API : booking ID, total and status
      API --> Client : 201 Created booking
      Client --> Customer : Confirmation, reference and total
    end
  end
end
@enduml
